<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 80,000 tonnes wheat for Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 80,000 tonnes wheat for Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on November 13 for up to 80,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat, ordinary protein, for donation to Bangladesh.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 1-25, 1996.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
